format: 2
name: JulcList.drop with a negative count fails on both sides
class: Probe
method: m
arg: 9f01ff
arg: 20
expect: AGREE
note: The JVM throws, and the script fails on the same input (ADR-068 B3). The arguments are the list [1] and -1.
